  "html": "<div id=\"question-135412\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">3.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/1913#9179\">Finding the Steady-State Vector of a Stochastic 2x2 Matrix</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"135412\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>A study determines how customers' yearly preferences change between the LB and SB telephone companies. The table below describes the results of this study.</p>\n<table rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"10\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 4mm; margin-top: 4mm\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; border-top:hidden; border-right:hidden\">From:</td> \n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td></td>\n<td width=\"60\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>LB</b></td>\n<td width=\"60\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>SB</b></td> \n</tr>\n<tr> \n<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; border-left:hidden; border-bottom:hidden\">To:</td>\n<td width=\"60\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>LB</b></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"38\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"39\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30